  "question": {
    "text": "Consider a uniform disc in the x-y plane free to rotate about an axis parallel to the Z-axis as shown (passing through the centre). A force of 4N applied at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;along y-axis, as shown produces an angular acceleration of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> . Locate the centre of mass of the disc if the mass of the disc is 2 kg.<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/0261598_nta.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 180px; height: 103px;\" />",
