  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "As <math><mi>&#964;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mn>4</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math><br /><br />Thus, COM is at (2, 3)",
